Third-party model
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This package is a client for the nope-edge model. It contains no model
weights, tokenizer files or other files from the model repositories, and it
does not redistribute them. Users download the model themselves from
NopeNet and run it on their own server.

The request format (no system prompt; one user message holding the text;
temperature 0; max_tokens 300), the output format, the list of 9 risk types
and the rule for dropping non-risk elements are taken from the nope-edge
model card. The parser and the mapping to @meddevkit/crisis-signals levels
are our own code.

